{"id":"474defd796e77816","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-n-equivalence.md","title":"Rank-bounded equivalence (legacy)","display":"df-n-equivalence — Rank-bounded equivalence (legacy)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-n-equivalence","aliases":["27-df-n-equivalence"],"display":"df-n-equivalence — Rank-bounded equivalence (legacy)","depends_on":["[[27-df-structure]]","[[27-df-satisfaction]]","[[27-df-sentence]]","[[27-df-quantifier-rank]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-n-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-n-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-n-equivalence — Rank-bounded equivalence (legacy)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea25e09b331cbbdb\" href=\"?note=ea25e09b331cbbdb\" title=\"27-df-structure\">27-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6\" href=\"?note=fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6\" title=\"27-df-satisfaction\">27-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b0b19b94b9984da\" href=\"?note=3b0b19b94b9984da\" title=\"27-df-sentence\">27-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ae3aea7249664c55\" href=\"?note=ae3aea7249664c55\" title=\"27-df-quantifier-rank\">27-df-quantifier-rank</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 是候选结构编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ea25e09b331cbbdb\" href=\"?note=ea25e09b331cbbdb\" title=\"27-df-structure\">27-df-structure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S,\\models,\\mathrm{qr}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S,\\models,\\mathrm{qr}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3b0b19b94b9984da\" href=\"?note=3b0b19b94b9984da\" title=\"27-df-sentence\">27-df-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6\" href=\"?note=fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6\" title=\"27-df-satisfaction\">27-df-satisfaction</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ae3aea7249664c55\" href=\"?note=ae3aea7249664c55\" title=\"27-df-quantifier-rank\">27-df-quantifier-rank</a>。引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{S,n}\">\\(\\equiv_{S,n}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\equiv_{S,n}\\mathfrak B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\\left[\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\leq n\\longrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\equiv_{S,n}\\mathfrak B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\\left[\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\leq n\\longrightarrow(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是目录遗留的一阶逻辑背景（legacy background），不是《Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications》的书内对应原子。本次保留其概念接口并修复类型、绑定和依赖；未取得该书的对应定义或页码，不声称依据原书核验。</li>\n<li>原有按句子量词秩比较的定义保留；不混同带自由变量的赋值等价。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"ea25e09b331cbbdb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3b0b19b94b9984da","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quantifier-rank","status":"resolved","id":"ae3aea7249664c55","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quantifier-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"ea25e09b331cbbdb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 固定，$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B$ 是候选结构编码，$\\mathrm{Struct}$ 见 [[27-df-structure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3b0b19b94b9984da","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_S,\\models,\\mathrm{qr}$ 见 [[27-df-sentence]]、[[27-df-satisfaction]]、[[27-df-quantifier-rank]]。引入 $\\equiv_{S,n}$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_S,\\models,\\mathrm{qr}$ 见 [[27-df-sentence]]、[[27-df-satisfaction]]、[[27-df-quantifier-rank]]。引入 $\\equiv_{S,n}$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quantifier-rank","status":"re